<blockquote class="uncited"><div>This Baofeng radio has an issue with its transmit audio and am wondering where I can get more recent firmware. Apart from this background noise, the radio works and is usable. <br><br>I know it has the A6 chip which i know is not supported. I just want to fix this noise issue to make it usable<br>and not just a receiver. As yet I have had no success in locating anything other than some old files.  <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_e_sad.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":(" title="Sad"><br><br>73's VK1JT.</div></blockquote>AFIK. This radio uses a DMR radio module rather than separate CPU etc.<br><br>I don't think Baofeng every published any updated firmware for this radio or any application/tool to upload firmware to this radio.<br><br>Possibly because the radio uses a module, which connects to the outside world via an old fashioned serial cable, the module may not support being updated at all<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Fri Jul 05, 2024 2:58 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
